---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<Page title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About The History of Computer Science, a series of essays by Attila Kulik.">
  <div class="about-page frame">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the series</p>
    <h1>Computing has<br />a human history.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The History of Computer Science is a series of essays by Attila Kulik about the people and ideas behind computing.</p>
      <p>Each essay begins with a concept, traces its history, and explains how it works through an everyday analogy. Technical terms are explained as they appear, and calculations are shown so that you can follow the reasoning.</p>
      <p>Sources are linked within the text and collected at the end of each article.</p>
      <h2>Begin with a parking lot</h2>
      <p>The first essay explores <a href="/how-a-parking-lot-explains-the-hash-table/">how a parking lot explains the hash table</a>: an idea from 1950s IBM that helps computers find things quickly.</p>
      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <p>I also write <a href="https://attilakulik.com">Subjective History of Philosophy</a>, a blog about philosophy, mindfulness, and ideas.</p>
      <p>You can follow new essays through the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Page>
